        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9023/203, Industrial Hanger 8 Inch Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Omnia Industries, the 8 Inch Hangar Cabinet Pull is crafted out of solid brass with the attention to high-quality that has made Omnia a leader in the door hardware industry. Choose from modern finishes like satin nickel, satin brass, and polished chrome to complete your contemporary kitchen make-over. This Industrial Hanger 8 Inch Cabinet Handle comes packaged with all the necessary hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pull is available in <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=omn-9023\"><b>Other Sizes</b></a>:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-102\"><b>4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-153\"><b>6 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-254\"><b>10 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-305\"><b>12 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-hangar-cabinet-pull-omnia-9023-457\"><b>18 Inch Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima 9023 Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
